{"channelId":"UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","row":["Jamelia Joseph",306,"Welcome! I’m Jamelia — a Caribbean wife, boy mom, mobile massage therapist, and your online bestie for all things self-care, beauty, and real life.\n\nThis channel is for women—especially moms—who give so much to everyone else and are ready to pour back into themselves. Here, you’ll find real-life vlogs, natural hair care routines, honest self-care tips, and a behind-the-scenes look at my life balancing motherhood, marriage, business, and growth.\n\nAs a Black woman navigating life with purpose and faith, I want this space to feel like a breath of fresh air—a place where you feel seen, encouraged, and reminded that your glow matters. Whether I’m sharing a massage tip, cooking for my family, talking about my journey, or showing a beauty routine that actually fits your life—I’m doing it with love and authenticity.\n\nIf you’re a woman who’s juggling it all and still trying to find your rhythm, you belong here.\n\nNew videos every week—Subscribe and let’s grow together!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:35.634Z","channelId":"UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0602b84d0d9455034b31dd03ee2cfcfaa8fead833454c893a241883065ea5efe","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"cc64febee9ed33de3176f6dca505da8c17bfbc72670d3e49d7a4965b07043176"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:35.634Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":306,"raw":"306 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKoLE6UNMH7gzYPZjwXcqDg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:35.634Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPag